  "findings": [
    "MatchData31643 constructs rankData; MatchPlayerData31644 has no initializers. Original fields uid/nick/url and VN_d/DN_d/VN_w/DN_w/VN_t/DN_t/playNum/isGetWechatInfo retained. Explicit interface properties avoid adding duplicate JSON names.",
    "MatchManager31658 always invokes LitJSON before Data assignment; null C# string fails in reader constructor, invalid typed data retains old record. Empty input returns null and triggers defaults. Original JsonReader71990 Text65543 has only [91 and {123 grammar columns, so literal root null65540 is rejected, unlike rankData:null inside object. First test used root null to trigger defaults and was corrected after confirming original grammar; implementation unchanged.",
    "Fresh Data is published before OpenID. UID assignment captures player before getter. Win count captures a new player, resolves current level twice, subtracts3 unchecked and applies source Clamp(value,0,second-3), including negative maximum under reentry. Loss count/nickname share a captured player, URL assignment resolves current record again. Existing nonnull data is not repaired.",
    "ConfigMgr30409 selects from existing ChineseNames via shared generic RandomHelper26198, System.Random.Next(list.Count), including final row. Distinct from ConfigHelper AI-name generation. Required current-level/OpenID providers remain externally supplied; test fixtures explicitly use level8 and fixture-openid.",
    "MatchManager uses original DataKey MatchManager, registration4130/Proj_hdzd/AutoSyntrue/Compressfalse, real OutgameDataManagerStorage and pool. OnInit requests server only when enabled and participating; no synthetic completion. OnSave uses LitJSON original field schema. OnRelease31659 is empty and retains Data. Login gates, digest-before-write and disabled-pool semantics are inherited without repair.",
    "MatchControl31646 invokes avatar initialization before GamePlayState listener;31648 only removes listener, retains manager/transmitter/update flag. Manager lazy lookup retries null and caches successful lookup. Source unused three rank dictionaries, dic_myData and camp list have no readers in the seven extracted control methods and are not represented by this adapter; rank result/display model and full transmitter remain pending.",
